  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve School Readiness for Vulnerable Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will work with caregivers of Children with disabilities and other community members to establish Inclusive Home-based Early Childhood Learning centers in Kamuli District Uganda to prepare children with disabilities and other vulnerable children for early enrolment in mainstream schools. The project will counteract some of the barriers to early school enrolment of these children including the high cost of early childhood education, long distance, knowledge gap on inclusive education.</narrative>
  </description>
